tmx:xhr:loadend</code></a></td><td>triggered when an ajax request ends</td></tr>{" "}<tr><td><a href="/events/#htmx:xhr:loadstart"><code>htmx:xhr:loadstart</code></a></td><td>triggered when an ajax request starts</td></tr>{" "}<tr><td><a href="/events/#htmx:xhr:progress"><code>htmx:xhr:progress</code></a></td><td>triggered periodically during an ajax request that supports progress events</td></tr>{" "}</tbody></table>{" "}</div>
